    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your kingdom has been destroyed, and only a few soldiers have managed to retreat with you. Now, you must rebuild your army from scratch, lead your troops into battle, experience the true thrill of war, where every punch lands and every strike bleeds, and feel the shock of massive army confrontations! Defeat your enemies and restore the glory of your kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Start from scratch to build a powerful legion and lead your troops into epic battles! <br>\u2022 Choose your units wisely, strategize, and command your army to victory on the battlefield! <br>\u2022 10+ types of soldiers with diverse growth combinations, creating an unbeatable army! <br>\u2022 10+ powerful skills that allow you to dominate the battlefield and showcase your commander\u2019s true strength!  <br>\u2022 Face players from around the world and fight for the top spot on the global leaderboard! <br>\u2022 Powerful commander skills that can turn the tide of battle and help you claim victory! <br>\u2022 A variety of monsters and bosses await, challenging your strategic limits!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your kingdom has been destroyed, and only a few soldiers have managed to retreat with you. Now, you must rebuild your army from scratch, lead your troops into battle, experience the true thrill of war, where every punch lands and every strike bleeds, and feel the shock of massive army confrontations! Defeat your enemies and restore the glory of your kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Start from scratch to build a powerful legion and lead your troops into epic battles! <br>\u2022 Choose your units wisely, strategize, and command your army to victory on the battlefield! <br>\u2022 10+ types of soldiers with diverse growth combinations, creating an unbeatable army! <br>\u2022 10+ powerful skills that allow you to dominate the battlefield and showcase your commander\u2019s true strength!  <br>\u2022 Face players from around the world and fight for the top spot on the global leaderboard! <br>\u2022 Powerful commander skills that can turn the tide of battle and help you claim victory! <br>\u2022 A variety of monsters and bosses await, challenging your strategic limits!</p>",
    "short_description": "Lead over a hundred soldiers with a variety of skills into battle! 100+ soldiers, 10+ different skills, and endless combinations await your exploration! Plus, you'll face opponents from around the world, all vying for the top spot\u2014are you ready for the challenge?",
